{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB娛樂訪談節目《一周星星》，今晚（1日）播出一集，請來美食節目《美食強人》4位主持陳豪（Moses）、龔嘉欣、陳浚霆（Andrew）及林秀怡擔任嘉賓，接受主持許文軒訪問，大談節目拍攝趣事之餘，更爆出多段鏡頭背後鮮為人知的秘密，內容甜蜜又爆笑。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.102179+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T07:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:38:30.011805+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"620049b7c15a1639a2ff71f5f6c3f9dbfbae5efb4b86c95642d4d314f4c52d5e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}